<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
F110-ZK-6085-BiglistboxTargetSize.zul

	Purpose:
		WCAG 2.5.8 Target Size (Minimum) - the Biglistbox scrollbars and frozen-column tick.

	Description:
		Only visible with za11y enabled.

	History:
		Fri Oct 02 2026, Created by peggypeng

Copyright (C) 2026 Potix Corporation. All Rights Reserved.
-->
<zk>
	<label multiline="true">
Requires za11y.
1. look at both scrollbars and at the tick at the bottom of the frozen-column divider: every button, both drag handles and the tick are at least 24px square and drawn in full
2. look at the tick: it does not cover the horizontal scrollbar's first button
3. click the End button of each scrollbar, then its Home button: the biglistbox scrolls to the last row or column, then back to the first
4. drag the tick one column to the right: a third column is frozen
	</label>
	<zscript><![CDATA[
		import org.zkoss.zktest.test2.big.*;
		FakerMatrixModel bigData = new FakerMatrixModel(100, 300);
	]]></zscript>
	<biglistbox id="big" frozenCols="2" colWidth="130px" width="800px" height="400px" model="${bigData}"/>
</zk>
